      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo make an Otemeale Pudding.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake a Porringer full of Oatmeale beaten to flower, a pint of Creame, one Nutmeg, four Eggs beaten, three whites, a quarter of a pound of Sugar, a pound of Beefe-suet well minced, mingle all these together and so bake it. An houre will bake it.\u003Cbr\u003E"
